<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>GH-42 · Live config migration</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-deep: #0b0a13;
      --bg: #12101c;
      --panel: #1b1830;
      --panel-2: #221e3d;
      --line: #37315c;
      --ink: #e8e4f4;
      --ink-dim: #a89fce;
      --ink-faint: #6f6994;
      --amber: #e8a33d;
      --cyan: #58c7d4;
      --green: #6fcf7f;
      --red: #e06c6c;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-width: 320px;
      background: var(--bg-deep);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: 15px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    .wrap { width: min(980px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 0 64px; }
    .lane-head { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    h1, h2, p { margin: 0; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.8vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    h2 { margin: 12px 0 18px; font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.3vw, 1.55rem); line-height: 1.3; }
    .statebar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px 14px; margin-top: 10px; color: var(--ink-dim); font: 12px/1.4 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
    .statebar b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
    .cost { color: var(--amber); }
    .answered { color: var(--green); }
    .floor { position: relative; margin: 7px 0; padding: 13px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; background: var(--panel); }
    .floor.current { padding: 20px; border-color: var(--amber); background: var(--panel-2); box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(232, 163, 61, .12); scroll-margin-top: 16px; }
    .floor.current::before { position: absolute; inset: 12px auto 12px -2px; width: 3px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--amber); box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(232, 163, 61, .65); content: ""; }
    .floor.pending { opacity: .53; }
    .floor-row { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 12px; min-height: 24px; }
    .name { font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .01em; }
    .note, .agent, .faint { color: var(--ink-dim); }
    .note { flex: 1 1 260px; font: 12px/1.4 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
    .pill, .key, .doc, .cite, .agent, .files { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
    .pill { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 7px; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 999px; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .09em; line-height: 1.35; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .pill.done { color: var(--green); }
    .pill.current, .pill.dec { color: var(--amber); }
    .pill.pending { color: var(--ink-faint); }
    .pill.failed { color: var(--red); }
    .pill.run { color: var(--cyan); }
    .agent { display: block; font-size: 12px; }
    .answers { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
    .ans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px 1fr; gap: 11px; align-items: start; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--bg); }
    .ans.rec { border-color: var(--amber); }
    .key { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 25px; height: 25px; border: 1px solid var(--amber); border-radius: 4px; color: var(--amber); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
    .label { font-weight: 700; }
    .oneliner { color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 13px; }
    .sect { margin-top: 21px; }
    .hd, .bhd { margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--cyan); font: 700 10px/1.3 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 24px; }
    li + li { margin-top: 3px; }
    figure { margin: 0; padding: 13px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--bg); }
    figure svg { display: block; width: 100%; max-height: 260px; color: var(--ink-dim); }
    figcaption { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 13px; }
    blockquote { margin: 8px 0; padding: 9px 12px; border-left: 2px solid var(--cyan); color: var(--ink); background: rgba(88, 199, 212, .05); }
    .cite { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--cyan); font-size: 11px; }
    .filegrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
    .box { min-width: 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 7px; background: var(--bg); }
    .bhd { color: var(--ink-dim); }
    .files { overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 12px; }
    .ok, .add { color: var(--green); }
    .stray, .del { color: var(--red); }
    .nextline { margin-top: 21px; padding-top: 13px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); }
    .nextline b { color: var(--amber); }
    .doc { display: inline-block; margin-left: 4px; color: var(--cyan); font-size: 12px; }
    details.floor > summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
    details.floor > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .chev { margin-left: auto; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 11px; transition: transform .15s; }
    details[open] > summary .chev { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    details.floor > summary:hover .name { color: var(--cyan); }
    .floor-detail { margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); display: grid; gap: 8px; }
    .floor-detail a { color: var(--cyan); text-decoration: none; }
    .floor-detail a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .links .doc { margin: 0 10px 0 0; }
    .pastdec { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-dim); }
    .pastanswer { color: var(--green); font-size: 12px; margin-left: 6px; }
    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .wrap { width: min(100% - 20px, 980px); padding-top: 20px; }
      .floor.current { padding: 16px 14px; }
      .filegrid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="lane-head">
      <h1>GH-42 · Live config migration</h1>
      <div class="statebar">
        <span>Stage <b>4 of 8</b> — execute</span>
        <span>3 stages done ✓</span>
        <span class="cost">Blocked 6 min · holding 1 heavy slot</span>
        
      </div>
    </div>
    
      
        <details class="floor">
          <summary class="floor-row">
            <span class="name">brainstorm</span>
            <span class="pill done">done</span>
            <span class="note">brainstorm.md · 12.4k tok</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="floor-detail">
            
              <div class="bhd">Artifacts</div>
              <div class="links"><a class="doc" href="artifacts/brainstorm.md">brainstorm.md</a></div>
            
            
              <div class="bhd">Decisions</div>
              
                <div class="pastdec">
                  <a href="decisions/198.html">Approve this brainstorm design?</a>
                  <span class="pastanswer">→ option 1</span>
                </div>
              
            
          </div>
        </details>
      
    
      
        <details class="floor">
          <summary class="floor-row">
            <span class="name">spec</span>
            <span class="pill done">done</span>
            <span class="note">spec.md · 8.1k tok</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="floor-detail">
            
              <div class="bhd">Artifacts</div>
              <div class="links"><a class="doc" href="artifacts/spec.md">spec.md</a></div>
            
            
          </div>
        </details>
      
    
      
        <details class="floor">
          <summary class="floor-row">
            <span class="name">plan</span>
            <span class="pill done">done</span>
            <span class="note">plan.md, touchset.json · 15.7k tok</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="floor-detail">
            
              <div class="bhd">Artifacts</div>
              <div class="links"><a class="doc" href="artifacts/plan.md">plan.md</a><a class="doc" href="artifacts/touchset.json">touchset.json</a></div>
            
            
              <div class="bhd">Decisions</div>
              
                <div class="pastdec">
                  <span>Ship the plan as written?</span>
                  <span class="pastanswer">→ auto: option 1</span>
                </div>
              
            
          </div>
        </details>
      
    
      
        <div class="floor current" id="decision">
          
  
    <span class="pill dec">decision · execute</span>
    <span class="agent">⚙ builder-agent · reversible · importance 0.8</span>
    <h2>Apply the schema migration now, or gate it behind a version check?</h2>
    <div class="answers">
      
        <div class="ans rec">
          <span class="key">1</span>
          <div><span class="label">Gate behind version check</span><br><span class="oneliner">Old daemons ignore the new column.</span></div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="ans">
          <span class="key">2</span>
          <div><span class="label">Apply immediately</span><br><span class="oneliner">Daemons older than 0.9 crash on restart.</span></div>
        </div>
      
        <div class="ans">
          <span class="key">f</span>
          <div><span class="label">Freeform</span><br><span class="oneliner">Type your own instruction back to the agent.</span></div>
        </div>
      
    </div>
    
      <div class="sect"><div class="hd">Done and verified so far</div>
      <ol><li>Migration written — migrate.go &#43;96</li><li>Engine reads it — tests pass (14/14)</li></ol></div>
    
    
    
      <div class="sect"><div class="hd">Evidence</div>
      <blockquote>Any schema change must be invisible to version N−1.<span class="cite">— spec.md §2.1 &#34;Compatibility contract&#34;</span></blockquote>
      <p>Option 2 contradicts spec.md §2.1 — picking it overrides the spec.</p></div>
    
    
  <div class="sect"><div class="hd">Files — plan vs reality</div>
  <div class="filegrid">
    <div class="box"><div class="bhd">Plan said (touchset)</div>
      <div class="files">internal/engine/**<br>internal/store/**<br></div></div>
    <div class="box"><div class="bhd">Actually touched</div>
      <div class="files"><span class="ok">✓</span> internal/engine/engine.go <span class="add">+142</span> <span class="del">−18</span><br><span class="ok">✓</span> internal/store/migrate.go <span class="add">+96</span><br></div></div>
  </div></div>

    <div class="nextline"><b>Next:</b> Press 1 in the TUI to accept the gate, or 2 to override the spec.
      Full docs: <span class="doc">plan.md</span> <span class="doc">spec.md</span> <span class="doc">diff.patch</span> 
    </div>
  

        </div>
      
    
      
        <div class="floor pending">
          <div class="floor-row">
            <span class="name">correctness-review</span>
            <span class="pill pending">pending</span>
            <span class="note">will review the same touchset</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      
    
      
        <div class="floor pending">
          <div class="floor-row">
            <span class="name">merge-verification</span>
            <span class="pill pending">pending</span>
            <span class="note">merge barrier</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      
    
  </div>
</body>
</html>




